Dialogue: 7,0:01:50.17,0:01:52.46,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs75\bord0\c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(600,0)\t(0,200,0.5,\c&H979797&)\t(0,200,\c&HB5B5B5&)\t(200,400,\c&HEEEEEF&)\t(400,600,\c&HFFFFFF&)}Iceburg-san
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might not be traveling in style,?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I gotta admit, this sure is handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought riding a\Nfish would be so comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, here it comes! No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's too high! Get ready!\NWatch out! I got it! Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.94,0:02:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was gonna get that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to play, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think there'd be canals\Nrunning by people's houses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to follow the map, but\NI don't want to miss anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, we're about to go against\Nthe flow, is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not supposed to go up, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You horsefish can swim uphill too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can't you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The canals go to the top\Nof the building! Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to go to the\Nshopping district! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna see the rest\Nof the city, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, look! Do something! Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, we're up pretty high, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.14,0:03:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I want to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop showing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best prices in town. Check us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you won't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're starting our 50 % off sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got rare goods for\Nthe distinguished customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, check out all the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We ended up in the shopping\Ndistrict after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you guys took a\Nshortcut, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lot smarter than\NI gave you credit for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has got to be the\Nbiggest market I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bull is huge! Whoa! Should we move?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming straight at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pinky eats people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this one is a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all wearing masks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, neat. They're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be going to a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freshly made water water\Noctopus dumplings for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three water water croquettes coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they sold food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, let's buy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, ask my ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, so you were hungry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water-water meat is the\NYagara's favorite food,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although we usually cook it for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take ten, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so good that the cooks from the\Ngourmet town come by them in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you never had anything like it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So soft! Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? They're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try one, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, I'm not sharing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, he's being mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make him share with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People all over town are wearing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something strange about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as we take the Watergate elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be at the Shipbuilding\NIsland in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this Watergate thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that tower right ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The elevator is ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bulls and riders, enter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proceed in an orderly fashion, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All aboard for Shipbuilding Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In downtown Water 7 at this time passengers\Nshould enter the elevator quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate will Be closing\Nin only one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something crazy is gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gate closed. It's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First you go in, the gate shuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the water fills the elevator, and\Nthen everybody floats to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't get it,\Nbut it sure is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.54,0:07:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really do use water\Nfor everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who are you calling "Moss Head"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. You know where Robin went?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not on the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said she was going\Nout with Chopper! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were doing some shopping, I think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I'm stuck on\Nthis ship alone with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the most\Nboring thing in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's why I'm sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to do our grocery\Nshopping so I'm taking off too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take good care of the boat while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the best shipyard\Nin the whole world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's even fancier than\Nthe rest of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got a lot more ground to work\Nwith than the residential district.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's so huge! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a bunch of people over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think something's going\Non at the shipyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, over there, it's Luchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pauly's here today, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about those guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Lulu, that's a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at that mustache!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's manlier than Tilestone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this crowd about? Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was just some boneheaded pirates trying
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to pick a fight with\Nthe shipwrights again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our guys send them\Npacking like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates will never\Nlearn their lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipwrights can beat up pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you must be tourists, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipwrights are, well, hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like celebrities to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you might say that\Nthis crowd is their fan club.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're always watching\Nthe Galley-La company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:11:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're strong, they're skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're the pride of\Nevery citizen in Water 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't wait to meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, let's hurry up and\Nget the gold traded in, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun, but it can wait till later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.33,0:11:33.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1091,389)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)\t(6440,6485,\1a&HFF&)}Water Seven\NBackstreet Shopping Area
Dialogue: 2,0:11:26.33,0:11:33.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1091,389)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,400)}Water Seven\NBackstreet Shopping Area
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says that we're in the\NBackstreet Shopping District.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems awfully crowded for a\NBackstreet, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda neat that they have\Nplaces to walk around, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have put a lot of\Nthought into the town's design.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that guy selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a mask shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed a lot of people\Naround town wearing them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they must buy them from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something you wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that was their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a big relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the people here take the\NSea Train to San Faldo Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where they hold a costume\Ncarnival every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people walking by\Nare talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.91,0:12:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you hear everything they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.74,0:12:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made it a habit to keep a\Ncritical eye and ear on my environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we found your bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.42,0:12:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we go inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is the best day ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm in my human form,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, maybe it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a funny mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, a human reindeer? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as you're having fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin? Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity, I was hoping that we\Ncould kill you in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards sure got a lot of nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.47,0:15:23.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1133,296)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)\t(355,400,\1a&H00&)}Currency Exchange
Dialogue: 2,0:15:17.47,0:15:23.90,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1133,296)\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(400,0)}Currency Exchange
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let down, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want the whole city to know\Nhow much cash we're lugging around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.20,0:15:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really gonna give\Nus that much money, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play it cool, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta handle these\Nthings like a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may sound like a lot, but that's\Nmost certainly what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has historical value and high purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a hundred million, we can make\Nthe Mary even better than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No kidding, and we'll\Nhave plenty to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll spend the rest on a\Nbig statue to put on the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you accept the amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I need your thumbprint\Nand signature here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I'll prepare\Nyour money lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have both my\Nthumbs if you want them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more thumbs, the better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving him a tillprint?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we sign anything, there\Nare three things I'd like to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Appraiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I forgot to mention this, but he's\Ngot a 100 million bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second, I don't accept\Nthe appraisal you gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Third, if you try to lie to us again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be the last lie you\Never tell. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,300 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skypiea paid off after all, I\Nnever thought I'd see the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I always wanted\Nto be filthy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our money too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleasure doing business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so comfortable having all\Nthis money in one place, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:16:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what if I trip and it\Nall falls out or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure were scary back there, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I estimated 300 million from the start,\Nbut I figured he wouldn't give it up easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really got to work on your game face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making me nervous\Nswinging that around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got our money now,\Nand that's what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dropped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let it fall in the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, that would've been bad\Nif the money got wet, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you lose my money,\Nyou're playing and flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep out and cramming down your throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, don't break my face anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.72,0:18:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know who we are? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we sure know you, Pirate Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Babies stop crying when\Nthey hear our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.30,0:18:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A collection of bounty hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the Franky family!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'll be taking that 60\Nmillion bounty you've got on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll wait inside that cabin of yours and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ambush the rest of your\Ncrew when they get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be rolling\Nin the dough in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that now, won't we? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two swords, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rhino!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psycho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should take the cash\Nback to the ship after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be a complete waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shipyard is right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't have\Nto ride so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me play with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we'll probably head\Nback to the Mary soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we meet with the shipwrights, I'm\Nsure they'll need to look at the damages?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before they can give us a quote.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.56,0:19:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.04,0:19:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could watch the money till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never carried so much\Ncash at once. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't flail it around and throw\Nit in any rivers and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, they're selling\Nwater buns over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's buy a hundred of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:19:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:19:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, back to the shipyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like the\Ncrowd's cleared out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have enough to deal with without the\NShipwright fan club getting in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is find that ice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait, what's his name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Iceburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, now I remember Ice Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old lady back at the train station\Nsaid that's who we needed to talk to,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that I think about it, we\Ndon't know anything about him, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's the only lead we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how this place works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it okay just to walk in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm doing! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of gumption\Njust waltzing in like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.38,0:20:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we take a step\Nover here, then we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's not personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're outsiders, so you're\Nnot allowed inside the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oopsy-daisy.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.74,0:21:11.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,405)\fs43\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Kaku\NGalley-La Company\NShip Carpenter
Dialogue: 2,0:21:06.74,0:21:11.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,405)\fs43\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(500,0)}Kaku\NGalley-La Company\NShip Carpenter
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Champ, what brings\Nyou to the docks today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usopp, I know it's you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here, Loopy! Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now that I look at\Nit, his nose is square.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that aside, we came here to\Nsee Iceberg, if that's all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, is that so, little miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not every day that\Nyoungsters come here with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a letter of introduction\Nfrom Granny Kokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hold on, how old are\Nyou? I'm 23. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, for someone who's\Nhardly any older than us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sure do talk like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you know Iceberg, or do\Nwe come to the wrong place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I know Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, I'd say that everyone here knows him,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seeing as he's the mayor\Nof the city and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.58,0:21:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.49,0:21:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Pops is an important guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn Skippy he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also the president of our Galley-La.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,company and manager of the\NC-train on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he was such a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you\Nweren't from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg is pretty famous in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.40,0:22:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But do you know where we can find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's the question, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He keeps pretty busy, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunting him down can be a chore sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you work for him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you get in touch somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I could, but it seems like\Nyou're in a hurry to get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not exactly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.50,0:22:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're rich to have your\Nship looked at, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you anchor it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's over by the rocky cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.96,0:22:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty then, I'll skedaddle\Nover there real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I take a gander at\Nyour ship beforehand,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can start talking cost\Nwith Iceberg right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I said, he's very busy, so I'm\Nsure he'll be grateful as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.06,0:22:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, skedaddle like how?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.04,0:22:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On a yagata or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were trying to save time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you folks can hang\Ntight for 10 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be back in two\Nshakes of a lamb's tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.70,0:22:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just 10 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, or your money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.48,0:23:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.15,0:23:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flew!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he jumps off the edge, he'll fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.64,0:23:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool, yeah, but is he gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.90,0:23:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He's always\Nsoaring through town!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh they call him the mountain\Nwind if you didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's the galley law company's\Ndoc one carpentry foreman kaku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.92,0:24:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the city of water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.84,0:24:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lives up to its name, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.24,0:24:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clean water, clean streets, fresh food,\Nand most importantly, plenty of cute girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place has it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my word for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.50,0:24:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is the perfect place to take that\Nspecial someone on a romantic stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.78,0:24:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why stop at one when\NI have two lovely ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.18,0:24:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is Nami, and\Nthis one here is Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.66,0:24:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scaring away the customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.96,0:24:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making that creepy face and tell me\Nwhich water water cabbage you want already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.02,0:24:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.46,0:24:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there was something\NI wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for some local specialties\Nthat are in season right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you have? Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place sure is a pain\Nwhen you have to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.46,0:24:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't stop running into dead ends and\Nstart figuring out where the hell I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this food's going to go bad\Nbefore I make it back to the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.18,0:25:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Zorro's brain fungus\Nis starting to spread to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.42,0:25:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, boy, am I glad to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.82,0:25:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Sanji! Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.12,0:25:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like another dead end to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.86,0:25:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to go is up, but there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.38,0:25:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I don't know what's\Nup with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.08,0:25:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going crazy, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.72,0:25:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Lock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.42,0:25:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.62,0:26:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just your sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.74,0:26:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.92,0:26:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they told me their\Nship needed repairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.76,0:26:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I didn't think it\Nwould be in shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.82,0:26:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should start by replacing this mast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I see you! Don't move! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.88,0:26:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't intend to disturb your nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.88,0:26:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, that was a big surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen someone\Njump that far before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.28,0:26:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my craftsmen are the best\Nin the business for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.80,0:26:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy? Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.20,0:26:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Extraordinary ships are not born\Nfrom ordinary circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.98,0:26:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They require a nearly\Nsuperhuman level of skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.54,0:26:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, Clover...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.12,0:26:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already finished\Nthe background check.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.92,0:26:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one in the middle is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.04,0:26:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His crew also includes Pirate\NHunter Zoro and Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.24,0:26:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their combined bounty is 239 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.18,0:27:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have four other members\Nwithout posted bounties,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and their crew was\Nformed in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.28,0:27:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Named after their captain, they're\Nknown simply as the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.94,0:27:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've really got our\Nnumber! I see. Welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:09.48,0:27:14.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286,472)\fs45\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(600,600)\t(555,600,\1a&H00&)\t(4320,4365,\1a&HFF&)}Iceburg\NWater Seven Mayor\NGalley-La Company President
Dialogue: 2,0:27:09.48,0:27:14.40,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286,472)\fs45\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(600,600)}Iceburg\NWater Seven Mayor\NGalley-La Company President
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.44,0:27:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.88,0:27:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the boss here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is a mouse I just picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.68,0:27:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its name is, let's see, Tyrannosaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.40,0:27:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll need some rodent food in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.58,0:27:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already taken care of that, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, amazing work, Carly Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.64,0:27:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.46,0:27:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.68,0:27:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're due at a hotel in Chess for lunch\Nwith a glassware factory executive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.78,0:27:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, you're set to make\Na speech at Liguria Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.44,0:27:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once that's finished,\Nyou'll be meeting with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.84,0:27:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bimini, the mayor of Pucci.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.16,0:27:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their local newspaper is scheduled\Nto interview you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and when you return to the office,\Nthere's a folder full of important documents?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.28,0:27:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your signature on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.08,0:27:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.50,0:27:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well. Then I'll\Ncancel everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're not serious, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.16,0:28:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point of having power\Nif I don't get to do what I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.26,0:28:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you run things, you\Ngotta be the worst mayor in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.54,0:28:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Pops, that's pretty lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, hold on, are you sure this is the\Nguy that old lady was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.84,0:28:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, he's the guy, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.16,0:28:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.98,0:28:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.22,0:28:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand here and\Nlet you insolent louts
Dialogue: 1,0:28:28.35,0:28:33.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,405)\fs43\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(500,0)\t(455,500,\1a&H00&)}Kalifa\NIceburg's Beautiful Secretary
Dialogue: 2,0:28:28.35,0:28:33.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,405)\fs43\bord0\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(500,0)}Kalifa\NIceburg's Beautiful Secretary
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,disrespect one of the world's\Nleading ship engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.10,0:28:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg's secretary just flipped\Nout on some pirates again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish she'd flip out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.92,0:28:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.22,0:28:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get a bit carried\Naway from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.64,0:28:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, Iceberg is a respected figure here\Nin Water 7, so try to show some courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, please don't provoke Kalifa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When she lashes out in\Nanger, her brain sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might have hurt his\Nfeelings, but you hurt his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.32,0:28:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way meaner than us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.00,0:29:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting all that behind us, if you're\NIceberg, you're the man we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, we brought a letter of\Nintroduction for you to look at.
