Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.54,0:29:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If money's the issue, we can pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.38,0:29:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're really the best, then you've\Ngot to be the one to fix our Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're begging.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.76,0:29:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.58,0:29:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.49,0:29:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why did you tear up the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.68,0:29:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lipstick mark was creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.58,0:29:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, Granny Kokoro and I have\Nbeen drinking buddies for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.59,0:29:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and since Kaku has already gone\Nto make an assessment for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would seem like a waste\Nto turn you down now,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.76,0:29:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.50,0:29:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not like I\Nhad anything better to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.78,0:29:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me show you around the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.28,0:29:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.19,0:29:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.34,0:29:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come along with me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.48,0:29:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he seriously cancel all of his\Nmeetings just to give us a tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.80,0:29:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.71,0:29:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta let me sit on\Nall the cool ships, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. The money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.72,0:29:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.96,0:30:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The money, it disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.62,0:30:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she drop it somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.54,0:30:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.68,0:30:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need it. You jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.46,0:30:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.54,0:30:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the cash!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.82,0:30:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us our money back!
